                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0e6dc052-8f39-3cd8-9640-8b14a20acec9",
                        "entry_id": "ad08b3a8-ecea-3f5f-9171-5ffe4ab4bb20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Luhansk"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cea24bd2-2026-4948-a270-ea8561b78dba",
                                "sense_id": "0e6dc052-8f39-3cd8-9640-8b14a20acec9",
                                "text": "„Wyprawa nasza, pod osobistém dowództwem Jenerała kawaleryi Emmanueala, dnia 26 czerwca opuściła ciepłe wody mineralne, w celu udania się do Elborusa. Towarzyszyli nam takoż Panowie członkowie St. Petersburskiey Akademii nauk: professor zwyczayny mineralogii, Kupfer; dozórca muzeum akademickiego, zoolog Menertie, fizyk, adjunkt professor, Lenc; doktor, botanik, Mejer z Dorpatu, i urzędnik górniczy fabryki ługańskiey, Ober-Hitten-Ferwalter Wansowicz.“",
                                "translation": "“Our expedition, under the personal command of General of Cavalry Emmanuel, left the warm mineral waters on day of June 26 to go to Elborus. We were also accompanied by the members of St. Petersburg Academy of Sciences: professor of natural mineralogy, Kupfer; caretaker of the academic museum, zoologist Menertie, physicist, adjunct professor, Lenc; doctor, botanist, Mejer z Dorpat, and a mining official of the Ługanski factory, Ober-Hitten-Ferwalter Wansowicz.“",
                                "english": "“Our expedition, under the personal command of General of Cavalry Emmanuel, left the warm mineral waters on day of June 26 to go to Elborus. We were also accompanied by the members of St. Petersburg Academy of Sciences: professor of natural mineralogy, Kupfer; caretaker of the academic museum, zoologist Menertie, physicist, adjunct professor, Lenc; doctor, botanist, Mejer z Dorpat, and a mining official of the Ługanski factory, Ober-Hitten-Ferwalter Wansowicz.“"
                            }
                        ]
